Geology sources — complete books, field methods, maps, and research (@geo-sources: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @geology) { r_3H47FYGCEYFZPW2VK77PMR0ECB
The books are the sustained reading spine; the Records provide original connecting explanations, exact assignments, calculations, and increasingly demanding work. Open licences, free consultation, and restricted or partially inspected material are identified separately. Source links and discovery imports do not add a Record to the geology learning selection.

